<header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">From the notebook</p><h1>Updates, occasionally.</h1><p>New work, teaching milestones, and things worth sharing.</p></header><section class="card updates-archive"><ol class="update-list">{% for item in site.data.updates %}<li><a href="{{ item.url | relative_url }}"><span class="update-date">{{ item.label | escape }}</span><span class="update-text">{{ item.text | escape }}</span><span class="update-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>{% endfor %}</ol></section>
